# Legacy non-Windows WAVEFORMATEXTENSIBLE GUID fields signed as int/short.
# Evidence: sndobj 2.6.7 portable-core adaptation, 2026-10-04.
id:                     E999
trigger_tool:           clang++|g++|cmake|conan
phase:                  compilation
error_signature:        narrowing conversion of .* from 'unsigned int' to 'int'|constant expression evaluates to .* outside the range of type 'int'|KSDATAFORMAT_SUBTYPE_PVOC|GUID.*Data1
severity:               2
category:               portability, c++, audio, source-patch
match_keywords:         WAVEFORMATEXTENSIBLE, GUID, Data1, Data2, Data3, narrowing, unsigned int, unsigned short, clang, OHOS, sndobj
title:                  非 Windows 音频 GUID 兼容结构误用有符号字段，导致标准 C++ 列表初始化缩窄错误
root_cause:             旧音频库在非 Windows 平台自行声明 GUID 时使用 int/short 字段，而 Windows GUID 的 Data1/Data2/Data3 是无符号 32/16/16 位。合法 GUID 常量的最高位可置 1；以这些常量初始化有符号字段会触发 C++ narrowing 错误。sndobj 2.6.7 的 KSDATAFORMAT_SUBTYPE_PVOC 第一字段为 0x8312b9c2，正好触发此问题。
affected_scope:         非 Windows 平台上自行声明 GUID/WAVEFORMATEXTENSIBLE 且以十六进制常量进行列表初始化的 C++ 音频库；须确认具体结构 ABI 宽度和原值语义。
verification_cmd:       clang++ -std=c++17 -c src/PVRead.cpp -Isrc -Iinclude && conan create archives/s/sndobj/2.6.7 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           source-patch
rec_description:        在非 Windows GUID 兼容结构中将 Data1 改为 unsigned int、Data2/Data3 改为 unsigned short；保持 32/16/16 位宽和布局，不改变 Windows.h 路径。随后编译实际引用该常量的单元并运行已安装消费者测试。
rec_command:            patch -p1 < patches/0001-src-SndWaveX.h.patch
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               source-patch
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      fixed-width-fields
fallback_description:   若目标平台 int/short 位宽无法保证，使用 uint32_t/uint16_t 并静态断言 sizeof(GUID) 与文件格式契约一致；不应仅压制 narrowing 诊断。
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          source-patch
forbid_1_pattern:       -Wno-narrowing|-fpermissive
forbid_1_reason:        只压制诊断仍保留错误的 signed GUID 语义，不能证明高位常量被正确表示。
forbid_1_consequence:   编译配置漂移时再次失败，或文件格式值比较出现有符号/无符号差异。
principles:             R6, R34
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             []
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []
source_lib:             sndobj 2.6.7
doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/E999-draft-SD67.md
last_updated:           2026-10-04
source_event:           sndobj 2.6.7 local GCC narrowing failure; patched source target Conan create and installed consumer PASS
authors:                2501_91199785
